
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The <a href="https://www.ploughandstars.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Plough and Stars</a>, a pub in Cambridge, Massachusetts, has begun hosting &#8220;philosophy nights&#8221;, and they&#8217;re a hit.</p>



<span id="more-27201"></span>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Last month, people piled into the place for food, drink, and a talk by <a href="https://shass.mit.edu/people/agustin-rayo/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Agustín Rayo</a> (MIT) on math and certainty. </p>



<figure class="wp-block-image aligncenter size-full"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="724" height="540" src="https://dailynous.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Plough-and-Stars-philosophy-night.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-27202" srcset="https://dailynous.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Plough-and-Stars-philosophy-night.jpg 724w, https://dailynous.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Plough-and-Stars-philosophy-night-300x224.jpg 300w, https://dailynous.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Plough-and-Stars-philosophy-night-250x186.jpg 250w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 724px) 100vw, 724px" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">photo via The Plough and Stars</figcaption></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Later this month, <a href="https://www.helenadebres.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Helena de Bres</a> (Wellesley) will be giving a talk there on &#8220;What is meaning in life?&#8221; and reportedly there are around 120 people <em>on the waitlist</em> to attend.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">While there is a high concentration of academic and academic-friendly folks in the Boston area, there are other dining establishments in the world where people go to occasionally listen to or discuss philosophy with philosophers. It would be good to hear about these, what they&#8217;re like, and how they&#8217;re doing. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">So tell us about the public philosophy going on in the bars and restaurants in your neck of the woods.</p>



